        1780,
        1585
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On May 5, 1958, I shall proclaim the period from May 15th to June 15th as Neighborhood Pedestrian Safety Month in New York City. During this period, 800 civic, service and fraternal organizations throughout the five boroughs will engage in activities designed to support and advance the Pedestrian Safety Campaign and its goal of reducing the number of pedestrian casualties on the streets of our City.",
