        1611,
        1745,
        1897
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Bumper strips and other materials as indicated on the enclosed form are available from the Department of Traffic. It is most important that each City Department and agency take part in this activity by ordering sufficient quantities of these materials to insure that all city units are able to participate.",
